  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-2493 open-field suite OF1 - on basic-desert's open field (x 60-440, y 440-580; scattered low walls, cars, sandbag walls, two tree clumps and a ditch on the south flank), a 6-man 'Blue Squad' moves east across the field (InfantrySquadMove to (420,510), a movement to contact) and meets a 3-man 'Red Squad' fire team dug in at x ~260 (foxholes + sandbags, SquadHold) at ~150 m. Judge: react to contact, then WIN and MOVE (ATP 3-21.8): Blue returns fire at once, every man is in cover within 20 s, nobody stands upright in the open in Red's sight, and the squad does NOT sit: it suppresses and moves (fire and movement, the south ditch is the covered flank) until the fire team is beaten within 300 s. Fail: the whole squad still for a minute while Red still fights (the ditch war), a man upright in the open in Red's sight 10 s, or the fight undecided. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh of-squad-meets-fire-team"
  },
